        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-07-11T19:43:01.498Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Jeysie\" data-post=\"20\" data-topic=\"28661\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/48/1868_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jeysie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>on the Delaware River near the real-life locations of Levittown, PA and Trenton, NJ.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yup, that’s it right there! Washington crossed the Delaware to fight the Battle of Trenton.</p>\n<p>Also, there are turkey vultures in the Northeast.</p>",
