        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-07-11T23:46:24.232Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My policy is that unless a given unusual discrepancy makes a plot become completely unworkable or it would add something particularly interesting to either the plot or a character to explain the discrepancy, I’m highly likely to apply the MST3K Mantra than worry about it.</p>",
