      {
        "id": 264316,
        "name": "",
        "username": "LonelyMan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2025-10-29T13:46:57.664Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It would be really funny if the whole reason Voss was in Champion Studios at the beginning of OblivAeon is that the Oracle of Discord showed him that the secret of Earths tremendously powerful mages and superheroes was the stories of heroism and fantasy that we tell ourselves.  So the Oracle essentially shows him a movie, which is about the power of movies, and so he makes his secret base in a movie studio, but does nothing having to do with movies while he’s there.</p>\n<p>(This is the wrong topic, I wanted Episode 119, but I think the comment works for a Disparation issue in general.)</p>",
